**Português:** 
- É imprescíndivel ter lido o [Regulamento da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) antes desta competição;
- A premiação acontecerá no [Campeonato Mineiro 2026](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoMineiro2026);
- Havendo qualquer dúvida, favor contactar algum dos organizadores ou Delegados listados.

---

**English:** 
- It is mandatory that you have read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) before this competition;
- The awards will take place at the [Campeonato Mineiro 2026](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoMineiro2026);
- If you have any questions, please contact one of the listed organizers or Delegates.
